# Local dev needs zero setup: without a DATABASE_URL the app serves the
# committed build-time snapshot (app/_data/catalog.json via db/data.ts).
# Just run: npm install && npm run dev
#
# To use a real Postgres SERVER (docker compose up -d db at repo root, or a
# hosted DB like Vercel Postgres / Neon), set DATABASE_URL and run
# `npm run db:migrate && npm run db:seed`:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://bbb:bbb@localhost:5433/bbb
